<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Beach Party</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Kevin MacLeod</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Missing Hits A to B</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">34xmYDzfYAhaXO90La4vur</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.560" end="00:10.710">We got an early start, going to have a fall (A)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.710" end="00:16.350">Going to ride the surf. yah, and that ain't all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.350" end="00:18.950">Nothin' is greater than the sand, surfing, salt air (A)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.950" end="00:21.330">Unrack our boards just as soon as we get there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.330" end="00:23.680">Stack em in the sand while they're breaking just right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.680" end="00:26.040">Yea we're surfin' all day and swingin' all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.040" end="00:31.690">vacation is here - Beach Party tonight.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.690" end="00:36.620">Chauking our board, we're in school</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.620" end="00:41.840">Now we're waxing our Ford, at the Balboa too.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.840" end="00:44.580">Nothin' is greater than the sand, surfing, salt air (A)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.580" end="00:47.150">Unrack our boards just as soon as we get there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.150" end="00:49.330">Stack em in the sand while they're breaking just right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.330" end="00:51.630">Yea we're surfin' all day and swingin' all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.630" end="00:56.780">vacation is here - Beach Party tonight.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.780" end="01:04.780" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(pause)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.850" end="01:17.350">We're here at last--- time is just right. (A)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.350" end="01:18.850" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(here at last--- time is just right) (C)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.970" end="01:23.420">We're trying to have Yah-- a Beach Party tonigt. (A)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.420" end="01:26.310">Nothin' is greater than the sand, surfing, salt air -(A)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.310" end="01:28.410">Unrack our boards just as soon as we get there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.410" end="01:30.840">Stack em in the sand while they're breaking just right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.840" end="01:33.460">Yea we're surfin' all day and swingin' all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.460" end="01:38.720">vacation is here (Beach Party tonight) (all)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.720" end="01:40.320">vacation is here (A)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.320" end="01:43.730">Beach Party tonight (C)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.730" end="01:47.730" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(fade out)</p></div></body></tt>